                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17928276" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 06:27:22 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;In the build code, the following content causes the issue: even though the global `gluten.enable` is set, the `NativeScan hive xxx.xxx` is not generated during the snapshot build step, leading to subsequent execution failure.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13074858/13074858_image-2025-02-19-14-26-58-795.png&quot; height=&quot;115&quot; width=&quot;731&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;When setting `gluten.enable=false` globally, the same exception still occurs because `spark.plugins=org.apache.gluten.GlutenPlugin` is configured, causing the execution to enter the Gluten logic and throw an exception.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17928277" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 06:28:20 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Enable Gluten only for internal table tasks. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Disable Gluten for non-internal table tasks. &#160;
	&lt;ul&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Exclude Gluten-related parameters when generating `spark-submit`. &#160;&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;Exclude Gluten-related parameters when retrieving Spark parameters in `exchangeSparkConf`.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ul&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</comment>
